{
  "name": "inject-types",
  "version": "3.261118.0",
  "source": "OpenAEV-Platform/openaev@d61524e (openaev-api/src/main/java/io/openaev/injectors, openaev-framework/src/main/java/io/openaev/injector_contract/fields, openaev-api/src/main/java/io/openaev/expectation/ExpectationBuilderService.java)",
  "intro": "The 8 injectors OpenAEV 3.261118.0 ships with, the 8 inject types (contracts) their code declares, and the contracts the platform writes for each payload and each phishing landing page. For each contract: the fields of its form, their key in the API, whether they are required, and the expectations it predefines. In the API, the teams of an inject go in `inject_teams` and its documents in `inject_documents`; every other field goes in `inject_content`, under its key.",
